OL,3,GNEWSAReduced rail service continues due
OL,4,Ato dry weather
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast year, the reduced timetable stayed
OL,7,Fin place until November 29 but SWR and
OL,8,FNR Wessex's managing director Lawrence
OL,9,FBowman said the timetable would be
OL,10,Frestored "as soon as possible".
